Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: automated plugin update system (v1.3.0)

Dashboard:
- TriggerUpdateButton: per-plugin update button in site detail page
- createUpdateJob server action: inserts update_jobs row
- Job history section with status icons and result logs
- Heartbeat API now returns pending_jobs in response

API:
- POST /api/v1/sites/jobs/[id]/complete: connector reports update result
- Heartbeat marks fetched jobs as 'running' to prevent double-dispatch

Connector v1.3.0:
- class-job-runner.php: executes plugin/theme/core updates via WP_Upgrader
- Silent upgrader skin captures log output for reporting
- Heartbeat now processes pending_jobs from API response
- Reports success/failure + version info back to cloud

